;;;   qna-vmul-*                 the product on cosets is associative and bilinear
;;;   quotient-na-is-cna         A/I is a complex normed algebra             (I closed)
;;;   quotient-na-complete       A/I is complete                            (I closed; complete-criterion)
;;;   quotient-na-is-cba         A/I is a complex Banach algebra             (I closed)
;;;   coset-norm-class-quot-norm ||x + I|| = QUOT-NORM(a, I, x)
;;;   quotient-ba-is-uba(-proper) A/I with the unit 1 + I is a unital Banach algebra, ||1 + I|| = 1
;;;                              (I closed and 1 not in I, resp. I /= A)
